; THE WRLD OS logon skin, made with Logon Skin Maker. You can also edit it here.
; Layout is signin or classic. Colours are #RRGGBB. Image is a PNG, JPEG, GIF or BMP
; path (leave it empty for the drawn background).

[Skin]
Name=Midnight
Description=The sign-in screen at night: near-black blue with violet and teal glows.
